<title>RUSSIA: Rouble eased to 5.464 per dollar in Moscow.</title>
<headline>Rouble eased to 5.464 per dollar in Moscow.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-11-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The rouble lowered to 5,464 to the dollar on the the Moscow Interbank Currency Exchange from 5,461 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>				    Nov 10		  Nov 6</p>
<p> Dollar rate		    5,464		   5.461</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
